//// set: vb-p1 — 函数体里的向量化调用（VB）；FFT 一路的函数调用 / 元组赋值数组目标（VFF）；函数里零长 fill（VFL）；scodeinst FuncVectorization5（VFV5）
//// model: VB1
model VB1
  function g
    input Real x;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := 2 * x;
  end g;
  function h
    input Real x;
    input Real k;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := k * x;
  end h;
  function f
    input Real u[:];
    output Real a[size(u, 1)];
  algorithm
    a := g(u);
  end f;
  Real r[:] = f({time, 2, 3});
end VB1;
//// model: VB2
model VB2
  function g
    input Real x;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := 2 * x;
  end g;
  function h
    input Real x;
    input Real k;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := k * x;
  end h;
  function f
    input Real u[:];
    input Integer n;
    output Real a[n];
  algorithm
    a := g(u[1:n]);
  end f;
  Real r[:] = f({time, 2, 3}, 2);
end VB2;
//// model: VB3
model VB3
  function g
    input Real x;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := 2 * x;
  end g;
  function h
    input Real x;
    input Real k;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := k * x;
  end h;
  function f
    input Real u[:];
    output Real a[2];
  algorithm
    a := g(u[2:3]);
  end f;
  Real r[:] = f({time, 2, 3});
end VB3;
//// model: VB4
model VB4
  function g
    input Real x;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := 2 * x;
  end g;
  function h
    input Real x;
    input Real k;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := k * x;
  end h;
  function f
    input Real m[:, :];
    output Real a[size(m, 1), size(m, 2)];
  algorithm
    a := g(m);
  end f;
  Real r[:, :] = f({{time, 2}, {3, 4}});
end VB4;
//// model: VB5
model VB5
  function g
    input Real x;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := 2 * x;
  end g;
  function h
    input Real x;
    input Real k;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := k * x;
  end h;
  function f
    input Real u[:];
    input Real v[size(u, 1)];
    output Real a[size(u, 1)];
  algorithm
    a := h(u, v);
  end f;
  Real r[:] = f({time, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6});
end VB5;
//// model: VB6
model VB6
  function g
    input Real x;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := 2 * x;
  end g;
  function h
    input Real x;
    input Real k;
    output Real y;
  algorithm
    y := k * x;
  end h;
  function f
    input Real u[:];
    output Real a[size(u, 1)];
  algorithm
